  "preparedness": {"title":"Personal preparedness — BBK guidance, not survivalism","text":"The BBK recommends being able to provide for yourself for up to ten days; even three days is a useful start. Prepare water, suitable food, essential medication, first aid, hygiene items, a battery radio, lights, charged power banks, important documents and some cash according to your circumstances. There is no recommendation here for weapons or vigilante action.","source":"bbk"},
